  "description": "Kang Yu-Jin, an executive director at Shin-A Food, has lived by the belief that proving herself through numbers and skills is everything. \n\nTo seize control of \"Shin-A Food\", her ultimate goal, she proposes a contract marriage to Ki Seung-Hyun, the president of SOO ENM. Ki Seung-Hyun, who lives while concealing his beastly nature, readily accepts her proposal to use him and cooperates by acting as a loving partner.\n\n**Original Novel:**    \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8119082), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=13230931) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=850889), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14158077)",
